# Smart Contract Test Coverage Report

## Auction Smart Contract Testing and Coverage Analysis

---

## Objective

The objective of this testing process was to validate the correctness, reliability, and security of the Auction smart contract using Foundry-based unit tests and coverage analysis.

The testing focused on:

- Auction lifecycle validation
- Bid placement logic
- Withdrawal mechanisms
- Seller verification system
- Fee management
- Security protections such as reentrancy prevention
- Administrative controls

---

## Testing Framework Used

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|----------|
| Foundry | Smart contract development and testing framework |
| Forge | Test execution and coverage analysis |
| Solidity | Smart contract programming language |

---

## Commands Used

### Run Unit Tests

```bash
forge test
```

### Generate Coverage Report

```bash
forge coverage --ir-minimum
```

### Generate LCOV Report

```bash
forge coverage --report lcov --ir-minimum
```

