## Test Cases Executed

### Auction Contract Tests

| Test Case | Purpose |
|-----------|----------|
| `test_AdminAndSellerManagement` | Tests seller registration, verification, and revocation |
| `test_AuctionValidationPaths` | Tests auction creation validation logic |
| `test_BidBelowHighestReverts` | Ensures low bids revert correctly |
| `test_BiddingAndWithdrawFlows` | Tests bidding and withdrawal mechanisms |
| `test_EndAuctionRevertsBeforeDeadline` | Verifies auction end restrictions |
| `test_ExtensionAndAuctionEndFlows` | Tests seller extension and auction finalization |
| `test_FeesAndViews` | Tests fee updates, withdrawals, and view functions |
| `test_LosingBiddersWithdrawExactAmount` | Ensures exact withdrawal amounts for losing bidders |
| `test_NoBidsAfterEndAuctionAndSellerReceivesFunds` | Verifies seller payout after auction completion |
| `test_Security_ReentrancyGuardPreventsDrain` | Tests reentrancy protection |

