## Security Validation

The following security properties were validated:

- Reentrancy protection using OpenZeppelin `ReentrancyGuard`
- Prevention of unauthorized seller verification
- Prevention of invalid bids
- Prevention of premature auction finalization
- Prevention of double withdrawals
- Proper handling of seller permissions

---

## Observations

- The Auction smart contract achieved more than 90% line coverage.
- All critical auction lifecycle functions were tested successfully.
- Security-sensitive paths such as withdrawals and reentrancy handling were validated.
- No failing test cases were observed during execution.

---

## Conclusion

The Auction smart contract was tested successfully using Foundry.

The contract achieved:

- High line coverage
- Complete function coverage
- Successful validation of security protections
- Stable execution across all implemented test scenarios

The testing results indicate that the smart contract behaves correctly under both normal and adversarial conditions.
